<title> Hemolytic Uremic Syndrome: Management.</title>
<graphic href="eee0642-w0001.gif" />
<cell type="start" id="cell-1">
<label>Suspect HUS: hemolytic anemia, thrombocytopenia, and acute renal failure</label>
<path target="cell-2"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-2">
<label>Signs of coagulation activation and secondary fibrinolysis (low fibrinogen and coagulation factors V and VIII, presence of fibrin degradation products in serum)?</label>
<path target="cell-3">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-4">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-3">
<label>Evaluation for disseminated intravascular coagulation</label>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-4">
<label>Diarrheal prodrome?</label>
<path target="cell-6">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-5">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-5">
<label>Medication associated with HUS?</label>
<path target="cell-7">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-8">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-7">
<label>Discontinue medication</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-8">
<label>Consider complement blockade and&#x002F;ortherapeutic plasma exchange</label>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-6">
<label>Severe CNS symptoms?</label>
<path target="cell-8">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-9">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-9">
<label>Hypertension?</label>
<path target="cell-10">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-11">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-10">
<label>Medical management</label>
<path target="cell-11"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-11">
<label>Symptomatic anemia?</label>
<path target="cell-12">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-13">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-12">
<label>Packed red blood cell transfusion</label>
<path target="cell-13"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-13">
<label>Platelet count &lt;10K or bleeding?</label>
<path target="cell-14">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-15">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-14">
<label>Platelet transfusion?</label>
<path target="cell-15"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-15">
<label>Indications for dialysis present?</label>
<path target="cell-16">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-17">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-16">
<label>Dialysis</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-17">
<label>Appropriate fluid management</label>
</cell>
<footnotes>
<footnote>Adapted from Kaplan BS, Katz J, Krawitz S, et al. An analysis of the results of therapy in 67 cases of the hemolytic-uremic syndrome. <em>J Pediatr</em> 1971;<strong>78</strong>:420-425.<xref ref="pubmed5101439" resource="acc007" />
</footnote>
</footnotes>
</algorithm>
